# NAKOS (Pi orchestrator) per-run outputs, written into the repo root by
# optimize.mjs / agent.mjs. Gitignored so they never dirty the tree that the
# optimize loop's safety gate guards, survive its per-iteration git reset/clean,
# and don't register as source changes. (neuron_test_output* + /wheelhouse/ above
# already cover the build/measure artifacts.)
run_log.jsonl
optimize_result.json
optimize_status.json
nakos_run.log
nakos_config.json
